WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,790 --> 00:00:06,070
It’s been half a day since the news about the acquisition of positioning cards

2
00:00:06,070 --> 00:00:07,590
Still no one comes to trade

3
00:00:07,590 --> 00:00:10,510
It seems that we won’t be able to get four positioning cards for a while. Hug.

4
00:00:10,510 --> 00:00:12,510
Help me check how many upgrade materials I have received recently

5
00:00:12,510 --> 00:00:14,470
Upgrade card to acquire fragments for 94 seconds

6
00:00:14,470 --> 00:00:15,750
Energy 17

7
00:00:15,750 --> 00:00:18,070
We are getting closer and closer to the loud noise level 4

8
00:00:18,070 --> 00:00:20,510
It would be great if I could come across a monster shop in the next two days

9
00:00:20,510 --> 00:00:22,150
The four of them are immortal

10
00:00:22,150 --> 00:00:23,750
I can't feel at ease in my heart

11
00:00:23,750 --> 00:00:37,910
What do you say?

12
00:00:37,910 --> 00:00:40,310
I have great luck and knowledge, give me a hug

13
00:00:40,310 --> 00:00:44,490
Take out a site designation card

14
00:00:44,490 --> 00:00:45,970
Any site selection card

15
00:00:45,970 --> 00:00:48,090
After use, it can be designated after the traffic light intersection.

16
00:00:48,130 --> 00:00:49,490
Type of entry site

17
00:00:49,490 --> 00:00:50,490
Jinxian once

18
00:00:50,490 --> 00:00:53,300
Whether to use it immediately

19
00:00:53,300 --> 00:00:54,900
Designate the site as a prop store
